@startuml
title T12-WF09 — AI CRM Conversation Summarizer
start
:01 | Webhook Trigger\nreceive an authenticated internal dispatch from NestJS after transcript source/access validation.;
:02 | Code: Validate Transcript\nvalidate source ID, type and maximum input length.;
:03 | Code: Normalize and Redact Transcript\nremove/mask unnecessary sensitive information before any AI request;
:04 | HTTP Request: Save Redacted Transcript\npersist the redacted source in a dedicated ConversationTranscript entity via NestJS;
:05 | HTTP Request: Get CRM Context\nfetch linked Lead/Customer and available recent interactions;
:06 | Code: Build Summary Context\nprepare concise context and source provenance for the model;
:07 | HTTP Request: Gemini Summarizer\nproduce structured summary, intent, sentiment and proposed action items;
:08 | Code: Parse and Validate Summary/Actions\nreject malformed output and mark unsupported or low-confidence items;
:09 | HTTP Request: Save Conversation Summary\npersist a dedicated ConversationSummary linked to ConversationTranscript;
:10 | HTTP Request: Save Conversation Action Items\npersist proposed actions in a dedicated ConversationActionItem entity with pending/review state as required;
:11 | HTTP Request: Notify Owner\nrequest in-app notification through NestJS.;
:12 | Code: Build Final Summary\nreturn result IDs and final status.;
stop
@enduml
